  "disclaimer_extra": "bartaco publishes nutrition per menu item: each taco is one taco (bartaco suggests 3 to 5 per person), and every other row is one order as served. Figures are bartaco's own, from the nutrition database behind bartaco.com/nutrition; the menu was checked against all 32 locations' printed menus dated 2026-10-06. bartaco prints calories but publishes no full nutrition for its sugary sodas and sparkling waters, the chicken + black bean bowl, the kids trays, the large guac + verde + roja or a gelato cone, so they are not listed. Items marked select locations are not on every menu.",
  "blurb": "Count your bartaco tacos, add guac, sides and a rice bowl, and watch calories, protein, carbs and fat add up for the whole table — every taco on the menu, with bartaco's own figures.",
